## 🔄 RESUME PATTERN (40-60% Token Savings)

**Pattern**:
```
1. Launch sub-agent → Save agent ID
2. Agent reports back → You review
3. If needs fixes → Resume with agent ID + feedback
4. Agent continues (keeps context!)
5. Repeat until success
```

**Example**:
```
Launch Agent 1 (180K tokens) → "328 → 150 errors, stuck on decorators"
Resume Agent 1 (+40K tokens) → "150 → 50 errors, pattern working!"
Resume Agent 1 (+35K tokens) → "50 → 0 errors ✅"
Total: 255K tokens

vs 3 Separate Agents: 180K × 3 = 540K tokens
Savings: 285K tokens (53%!)
```

