## 🚨 ANTI-PATTERNS

### ❌ DON'T:
- Launch sub-agent without saving ID (can't resume!)
- Let master agent read 30+ files (use sub-agents!)
- Launch fresh agent for corrections (resume instead!)
- Skip token tracking (need cost data!)

### ✅ DO:
- Save all agent IDs immediately
- Use sub-agents for heavy work
- Resume for iterations
- Track tokens at all levels

